{
  "headline": "Argatroban is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a plant classified OAI 259 days before the latest inspection posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "E13", "E11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include argatroban as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Corvale East and Corvale General stock argatroban 50 mg/50 mL vials labeled by Eugia US LLC with NDC 55150024101.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label identifies the manufacturing plant as Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited (FEI 3008461619) in India.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected that plant on 2026-02-06 and classified the inspection OAI; the classification was posted on 2026-09-21.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An earlier OAI inspection ended 2024-02-02 with a warning letter issued 2024-08-15.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 8.2 days of supply on hand while Corvale General has 16.5 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 23 vials of the 50 mg/50 mL presentation from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to about 11 days on hand while Corvale General retains roughly two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
